      "writtenOn": "2026-10-27T02:26:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is for the devices exposed by board configurations. A device described in a platform configuration also has to be exposed by a board configuration, and its platform record refers to that exposed device by board and name:\n```\nex:\n/xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system\n|- board\n|  |- Nvidia_IMGX_ConnectX8_SuperNIC_Switch\n|  |  `- GPU_SMA_0_VDM            \u003c- board config Exposes (bridge device)\n|  `- Nvidia_RTX_PRO_6000_Blackwell_0\n|     |- NVIDIA_RTX_PRO_6000_VDM  \u003c- board config Exposes (device behind the bridge)\n|     `- MCU                      \u003c- board config Exposes (direct I2C target)\n`- platform\n   `- Nvidia_MGX_ConnectX8_SuperNIC_Server\n      |- GPU_SMA_0                \u003c- platform config record for GPU_SMA_0_VDM\n```",
      "parentUuid": "9346c6ac_6ce29b8d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3,
        "startChar": 17,
        "endLine": 3,
