        "id": 1002790
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-27T02:26:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The service creating the item doesn\u0027t need it. It matters when several services create objects for the same device, for example `pldmd` and `spdmd`. Each picks its own object path, so today `bmcweb` cannot tell that those objects belong to one device. With each of them linked by `configured_by` to the same configuration object, `bmcweb` can gather them through that object\u0027s `configures` association.",
      "parentUuid": "587a3438_4f35a54d",
